  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Clicking the orb in the designer now opens the orb menu on the design surface. The real drop-down is a top-level window the designer process cannot keep on screen, so the designer paints the menu itself - menu, recent and option items with their icons, row highlighting, click-to-select, and the \"+\" glyphs that add new entries - the same approach the panel \"Add Control\" menu already used. The runtime API is unchanged from 1.0.5-net10.",
